”¦0.15.0ÜQ£abs¤sizeÙThe size of the brackets, relative to the height of the wrapped content.

Default: The current value of @math.lr.size[`lr.size`].¤bodyÙ-The expression to take the absolute value of.¦accent¤baseÙhThe base to which the accent is applied. May consist of multiple
