than or equal to $1$.©calc.asinÙDThe number whose arcsine to calculate. Must be between $-1$ and $1$.ªcalc.asinhÙ6The number whose inverse hyperbolic sine to calculate.©calc.atanÙ)The number whose arctangent to calculate.ªcalc.atan2¡x³The $x$ coordinate.¡y³The $y$ coordinate.ªcalc.atanhÙcThe number whose inverse hyperbolic tangent to calculate. Must be
between $-1$ and $1$ (exclusive).ªcalc.binom¡nÙLThe value of $n$: The numbers of items to choose from. Must be
