#show ref.where(
  form: "normal"
): set ref(supplement: it => {
  if it.func() == heading {
    "Chapter"
  } else {
    "Thing"
  }
})

= Introduction <intro>
In @intro, we see how to turn
Sections into Chapters. And
in @intro[Part], it is done
manually.
